    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We NEED someone to fix this computer <strong><i>as soon as possible</i></strong>. Apparently that weird edutainment game was modified by someone. Yeah, the one where you battle those &quot;parent-approved&quot; monsters or whatever. What's it called again? Wasn't it\u00a0<strong><i><u>Edumon</u></i></strong>\u00a0or something like that? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We <i>can't</i> let students see this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, I don't care who did it, I just need it fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, <strong>you.</strong>\u00a0Could you do me a favor and stay a little longer today?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through Edumon from start to finish to make sure the game is working properly. Do things such as: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/7a94ff55185699f91d72870ebeedb064.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/7a94ff55185699f91d72870ebeedb064.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/7a94ff55185699f91d72870ebeedb064.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore through the <i>modded</i> map to find items, challenges, puzzles, and hopefully, an exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/f8feafd2b4dd378fec43fe0c14693382.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/f8feafd2b4dd378fec43fe0c14693382.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/f8feafd2b4dd378fec43fe0c14693382.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your acquired power and items to battle tough monsters and prove you really are smart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/333d304732e94015f57f6d6e20c566d4.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/333d304732e94015f57f6d6e20c566d4.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/333d304732e94015f57f6d6e20c566d4.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your intelligence with puzzles that go beyond the game itself to open up new areas and progress through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEBUG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the game files for possible corruptions or other issues that may be hindering the game experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAVE FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to  check your game files; You never know what may be lurking around the corner.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We NEED someone to fix this computer <strong><i>as soon as possible</i></strong>. Apparently that weird edutainment game was modified by someone. Yeah, the one where you battle those &quot;parent-approved&quot; monsters or whatever. What's it called again? Wasn't it\u00a0<strong><i><u>Edumon</u></i></strong>\u00a0or something like that? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We <i>can't</i> let students see this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, I don't care who did it, I just need it fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, <strong>you.</strong>\u00a0Could you do me a favor and stay a little longer today?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/9b1bc7bf2159141e171aebdcc53e5fca.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through Edumon from start to finish to make sure the game is working properly. Do things such as: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/7a94ff55185699f91d72870ebeedb064.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com