 that go beyond the game itself to open up new areas and progress through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEBUG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/431799b309bc7a50b9cbeef1134a8923.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the game files for possible corruptions or other issues that may be hindering the game experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAVE FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.poster.avif?t=1754590383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.webm?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/6444543e5190c599d1a29dd633a8f399.mp4?t=1754590383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to  check your game files; You never know what may be lurking around the corner.</p>",
